          "@value": "L1 guideline → recommendation candidates (L1 3.0)"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Find every normative sentence of an ingested `library/` entry (folio-assistant-core's `l1-coverage` markers), flag uncertain readings, and propose the publication's identity. Given an agent's `l1-recommendation-curation/v1`, refuse a non-verbatim statement or an unknown location, and write the recommendations and remarks as an L1 3.0 graph (checked with `L1/schemas/validate.ts`) with coverage and proposed, unsigned exclusions."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "l1-recommendation-candidates",
      "dcterms:source": "smart-base/L1/tools/l1-recommendation-candidates/l1-recommendation-candidates.ts#l1-recommendation-candidates",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
