          "@value": "L1 recommendations → L2 user-scenario candidates"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "From an agent's `l1-scenario-mapping/v1`, write one smart-kg L2 `user-scenario` candidate per L1 recommendation, joined to a `persona` and a `business-process` by smart-kg L2's existing edges. Reuses the guide's own personas and processes, then smart-base's generic `DAK.Persona.*`; otherwise a glossary candidate or `could-not-determine`, each with a WARNING. Never invents a process."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "l1-recommendation-scenarios",
      "dcterms:source": "smart-base/L2/tools/l1-recommendation-scenarios/l1-recommendation-scenarios.ts#l1-recommendation-scenarios",
